flowchart TD

A[Input Definition<br/>- Molecular system<br/>- Initial structures<br/>- Conditions] --> B[Exploration Layer]

B --> B1[Semiempirical QM<br/>(baseline AutoMeKin)]
B --> B2[ML Potential Exploration<br/>(MACE / UMA)]

B1 --> C[Reaction Candidates]
B2 --> C

