E --> G[Reaction Network Construction<br/>Graph: nodes + edges]

G --> H[Analysis Layer<br/>- kinetics<br/>- pathways<br/>- barriers]

H --> I[Reporting<br/>- figures<br/>- tables<br/>- publication outputs]
